{
  "sn35.32:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.32 ",
  "sn35.32:0.2": "3. All ",
  "sn35.32:0.3": "The Practice Conducive to Uprooting (2nd) ",
  "sn35.32:1.1": "“Mendicants, I will teach you the practice that’s conducive to uprooting all conceiving. ",
  "sn35.32:1.2": "Listen … ",
  "sn35.32:1.3": "And what is the practice that’s conducive to uprooting all conceiving? ",
  "sn35.32:2.1": "What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "sn35.32:2.2": "Is the eye permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.32:3.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” ",
  "sn35.32:4.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, is it suffering or happiness?” ",
  "sn35.32:5.1": "“Suffering, sir.” ",
  "sn35.32:6.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: ",
  "sn35.32:6.2": "‘This is mine, I am this, this is my self’?” ",
  "sn35.32:7.1": "“No, sir.” ",
  "sn35.32:8.1": "“Are sights … ",
  "sn35.32:8.2": "eye consciousness … ",
  "sn35.32:8.3": "eye contact … ",
  "sn35.32:9.1": "",
  "sn35.32:10.1": "The pleasant, painful, or neutral feeling that arises dependent on eye contact: is that permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.32:11.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” ",
  "sn35.32:12.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, is it suffering or happiness?” ",
  "sn35.32:13.1": "“Suffering, sir.” ",
  "sn35.32:14.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: ",
  "sn35.32:14.2": "‘This is mine, I am this, this is my self’?” ",
  "sn35.32:15.1": "